      "widgets_values": [
        "toxicdog MOSS SFT Turbo INT8 ConvRot AIO\n\nUse ComfyUI 0.42.1 or newer. Native MOSS support was added in 0.42.0; 0.42.1 fixes crashes affecting the MOSS template. Desktop: update the engine for this instance through Manage > Update, then restart. No nightly engine is required.\n\nKeep moss_image_sft_turbo_int8_convrot_aio.safetensors in models/checkpoints. Load Checkpoint is the publisher-specified loader. The checkpoint supplies MODEL, CLIP and VAE. No separate Qwen/VAE download or extra Turbo LoRA is required for this AIO.\n\nPublisher recipe: 8 steps, CFG 1, Euler/simple, denoise 1, native shift 5, 1024x1024. No ModelSampling override or SLG. Empty negative conditioning keeps the sampler input connected; negative guidance is inactive at CFG 1. Prompt Palette controls the connected seed.\n\nhttps://huggingface.co/toxicdog/MOSS-Image-SFT-Turbo-INT8-ConvRot-AIO\n\nGraph wiring and real checkpoint-header detection checked; GPU loading/inference not run here."
      ],
